flowchart LR
  T["Criteria first: before the child answers"] --> A["The child's answer, in their own words"]
  A --> C["Code check: empty or too short?"]
  C -->|yes| M["Ask for a little more: no verdict yet"]
  M -. "the child adds more" .-> A
  C -->|no| U["Kept for the tutor: not judged by code"]
  U --> J["AI judge: 1 verdict a criterion"]
  J --> F["Feedback: short, kind, 1 next step"]
